{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":36695,\"title\":\"Storyville\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Showcasing the best in international documentaries, Storyville has developed an enviable reputation since its inception more than a decade ago. Screening over 340 films, from some 70 different countries, the strand has garnered a staggering array of awards: five Oscars, 15 Griersons, three Peabodys and two International Emmys. In true, unique, Storyville style, the new series promises to deliver the strand's usual eclectic mix of compelling stories from across the globe.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zLOvaj0zL70g2rxctAnLO3kMw0W.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xrr0YK9pXO5MhsPUK1kVSLAIOqK.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":9,\"year\":1997,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":30,\"totalEpisodes\":770,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"BBC Four\",\"BBC Two\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-10-20\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1467926,\"name\":\"Jennifer Fox\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d1z8dsmC3L5QcNPvloY6DcbNXYp.jpg\"},{\"id\":1689566,\"name\":\"Brad Lichtenstein\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1037293,\"name\":\"Hannah Rothschild\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":113425,\"name\":\"David Grubin\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":12150,\"name\":\"Maximilian Schell\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nGUOlMAgcXzLAEoQnKXQJ2KvWxb.jpg\"},{\"id\":79000,\"name\":\"Manuel Martín Cuenca\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1140442,\"name\":\"Roger Ross Williams\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tYKbOfNbK4JPeAsiEAdm9jCsss3.jpg\"},{\"id\":1179593,\"name\":\"Aiyana Elliott\",\"charact